      {
        "evidence_id": "M",
        "snippet": "Tackle the asylum backlog by establishing a dedicated unit to improve the speed and quality of asylum decision-making, introducing a service standard of three months for all but the most complex asylum claims to be processed, and speeding up returns of those without a right to stay. Lift the ban on asylum seekers working if they have been waiting for a decision for more than three months.",
